  "visualBrief": "The Old and New Palace ranges rise over the Avignon square. The west façade has blind arcades, square keeps, tall southern chapel recesses and the twin spired Champeaux turrets. The open Court of Honour, cloister and eastern gardens follow the mapped precinct.",
